helperconnect/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is trustpilot-ai-pipeline. The Claude Projects folder is merely its
# working directory, so ~60 unrelated things sit alongside it: other projects
# (several with their own remotes), scratch scripts, data exports and secrets.
# They are listed explicitly rather than with a blanket rule, so that genuinely
# new files still show up in git status instead of being silently swallowed.
#
# Never remove these three — each is a live secret or personal data:
#   CyberSourceKey_*.pem                  private key
#   .mcp.json                             literal GitHub PAT
#   Cybersource ... (filled)...json       filled credentials
#   Eglinton Email list.csv               customer email addresses
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.claude/

# Scaffolding written by `npx skills add` (Stripe docs skills). The skills
# themselves live in .agents/; .kiro/ and .trae/ are symlink trees it makes
# for editors we don't use. Re-creatable from skills-lock.json, so none of
# it belongs in this repo.
